hadiths[56]{hadithnumber,text}:
"156","'Ali ibn Talib reported that when the illness of the Prophet"
"157","'Abdullah reported that the Prophet"
"158","""The prayer! The prayer! Fear Allah concerning\nyour slaves!"""""""""
"159","Abu'd-Darda' used to say to people. """"We know you better than the\nveterinarian knows his animals. We recognise the best of you from the worst\nof you. The best of you is the one whose good is hoped for and the one\nwhose evil you are safe from. As for the worst of you"
"160","Abu Umama said"
"161","Al-Hasan reported that a man ordered one of his slaves to draw\nwater using one of his camels and the man fell asleep. The master came\nwith a torch and put it in his face and the slave fell into the well. In\nthe morning"
"162","'Amra reported that 'A'isha had made one of her slavegirls a mudabbar\n(one who would be set free after her death). Then 'A'isha became ill and\nher nephews consulted a gypsy doctor. He said"
"163","Abu Umama said"
"164","Anas said"
"165","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"166","Laqit ibn Sabira reported that his father said"
"167","Abu'l-'Aliyya said"
"168","Salman said"
"169","same as 168."""""
"170","Yazid ibn 'Abdullah said"
"171","Abu Mas'ud said"
"172","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"173","Abu Hurayra said"
"174","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"175","Jabir said"
"176","Hilal ibn Yasaf said"
"177","Ibn 'Umar said"
"178","Mu'awiya ibn Muqarrin said"
"179","Shu'ba said"
"180","Abu 'Umar Zadhan said"
"181","'Ammar ibn Yasir said"
"182","Abu Layla said"
"183","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"184","Umm Salama reported that the Prophet"
"185","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"186","same as 185."""""
"187","'Ubada ibn al-Walid said"
"188","Jabir ibn 'Abdullah said"
"189","Al-Ma'rur ibn Suwayd said"
"190","Sallam ibn 'Amr reported from one of the Companions of the Prophet"
"191","Abu Hurayra said"
"192","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"193","Same as 192."""""
"194","Ma'rur said"
"195","Al-Miqdam heard the Prophet"
"196","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"197","Abu Hurayra said"
"198","Ibn Jurayj related that Abu'z-Zubayr heard him ask Jabir about\nwhen a man's servant has finished his work and heat (i.e. cooking). Did\nthe Prophet"
"199","Jabir ibn 'Abdullah said"
"200","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"201","Abu Mahdhura said"
"202","'Abdullah ibn 'Umar reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"203","'Three have a double reward: one of\nthe People of the Book who believes in his Prophet and then believes in\nMuhammad has two rewards. When a slave carries out the due of Allah and\nthe due of his master"
"204","Abu Musa reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"205","Abu Burda reported from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"206","Ibn 'Umar reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"207","Abu Hurayra said"
"208","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"209","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"210","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"211","Mutarrif reported that his father said"
